      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING TESFAY (2) has a strong record this trip with seven wins and two placings from 12 starts. Was out of placings last time (16.85) at Healesville in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 2.75 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. PAW UMA (1) struggled to get involved last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by one length at Bendigo (24.06) beating Knockabout Kid in a Grade 5 on November 12. Must be included in calculations. LAID BACK LASS (4) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at this track following on from a third place finish (22.31) there the start prior. Has a good record here at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Has ability and can measure up. HONEY STIRRER (5) should be thereabouts.",
